{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tsm0420/geo-growth-engine/pulls/19","id":4908248155,"node_id":"PR_kwDOVMrF8s8AAAABJI3sWw","html_url":"https://github.com/tsm0420/geo-growth-engine/pull/19","diff_url":"https://github.com/tsm0420/geo-growth-engine/pull/19.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/tsm0420/geo-growth-engine/pull/19.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tsm0420/geo-growth-engine/issues/19","number":19,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"TICKET-016 Preflight installation destination access before writing","user":{"login":"tsm0420","id":62269874,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyMjY5ODc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/62269874?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsm0420","html_url":"https://github.com/tsm0420","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsm0420/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsm0420/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsm0420/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsm0420/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsm0420/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsm0420/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsm0420/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsm0420/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsm0420/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n\nFixes #18. TICKET-016 preflights each installation destination's nearest existing parent before creating configuration or skills.\n\n```text\ninstall/init\n  -> check all conflicts, sources and destination-parent access\n  -> create files exclusively\n```\n\nA later mode-0555 skill parent previously caused EACCES after an earlier skill was installed; retry then conflicted with that partial file. The corrected preflight leaves no earlier skill behind and allows a clean retry after permissions are corrected. Existing owner files and symlink protections remain intact. This is predictable preflight, with no transactional/concurrency rollback guarantee.\n\nStacked on open, unmerged PR #17 (codex/agensi-skill-packages) and transitive #16/#15/#14/#13/#12/#11/#9. No merge or release.\n\n## Evidence\n\n- **Before:** real CLI red regression fails on the extra geo-orchestrator path after later-parent EACCES.\n  **After:** regression and retry pass; six new CLI controls plus seven safety tests pass. Full suite 127 pass, zero fail/skip; typecheck/build exit 0. Separate Standards and Spec reviews have no actionable findings.\n- Immutable source 7c4fa4b96580856d130215daae6c4b7425388951 also passed clean-source install/typecheck/127 tests/build. Actual runtime: unprivileged macOS arm64, Node 24.22.0/npm 11.19.1; Windows/root permission behavior unmeasured.\n- Local tarball SHA-256 d6ec7021d6712388fee2d682105771f75190013826a8fa877d9de01cd2c285db, installed via npm into a separate consumer: 14 expected CLI outcomes, all six commands, real bin entrypoint, permission failure/retry, conflict/type/symlink controls and retained imported bytes. All 22 packaged files and 37 execution/build/CI inputs were compared byte-for-byte.\n- Candidate manifest/raw receipts are retained under `docs/verification/TICKET-016/candidate`; source CI and separate review addenda are also retained. All 37 execution/build/CI/package inputs remain identical at the final documentation head. Final head `5fb6baceefa64dc028c5af0c6b13745bee744de3`: Code Review verified [job 117649968778 / run 39118798292](https://github.com/tsm0420/geo-growth-engine/actions/runs/39118798292/job/117649968778), completed/success: typecheck, 127 tests (127 pass, zero fail/skip), build. Full untruncated 35,311-character final log is retained locally under `reports/candidates/TICKET-016/ci-final.raw.json`. The known deprecated whatwg-encoding warning remains documented under issue #7.\n\n## Merge Danger\n\n**Door:** two-way\n\n**Blast Radius:** installation\n\nShared init/install preflight only. No existing Agensi archive/upload changes, dependency updates, production edits, merge or release.","created_at":"2026-10-18T10:17:07Z","updated_at":"2026-10-18T10:20:51Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"c5bf6a0923bea182fce0dae1848d100c91af5137","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tsm0420/geo-growth-engine/pulls/19/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tsm0420/geo-growth-engine/pulls/19/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tsm0420/geo-growth-engine/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tsm0420/geo-growth-engine/issues/19/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tsm0420/geo-growth-engine/statuses/5fb6baceefa64dc028c5af0c6b13745bee744de3","head":{"label":"tsm0420:codex/install-destination-preflight","ref":"codex/install-destination-preflight","sha":"5fb6baceefa64dc028c5af0c6b13745bee744de3","user":{"login":"tsm0420","id":62269874,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyMjY5ODc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/62269874?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsm0420","html_url":"https://github.com/tsm0420","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsm0420/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsm0420/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsm0420/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsm0420/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsm0420/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsm0420/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsm0420/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsm0420/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsm0420/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_adm